            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "testing/testcontext-framework/bean-overriding.html#testcontext-bean-overriding-custom"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", and the original instance is wrapped in a Mockito spy. This strategy requires that exactly one candidate bean exists."
          }
